se</button></div>`).join('')}</div></div><aside class="building-design-controls"><h4>1. View your item</h4><canvas data-building-3d-preview aria-label="3D preview of the selected building item"></canvas><p data-building-edit-status>Choose an item from the list to view it here.</p><button type="button" data-building-spin aria-pressed="false">Rotate 3D preview</button><h4>2. Choose paint · <span data-building-paint-label>Natural finish</span></h4><button type="button" data-building-natural>Natural finish</button><div class="building-paint-options" role="group" aria-label="Building paint colors">${SPRAY_COLORS.map((color,index)=>`<button type="button" class="building-paint-choice" data-brick-color="${index}" style="--paint-color:#${color.hex.toString(16).padStart(6,'0')}" aria-label="Paint ${color.name}" aria-pressed="false"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>${color.name}</button>`).join('')}</div><p>Paint is shown in the preview and applied to each new drop.</p><div class="building-select-actions"><button type="button" data-building-equip>Select item</button><small>Closes this menu. Click in the world to drop copies. Use XYZ / Scale beside the highlight to move, rotate or resize.</small></div></aside></section><section class="building-catalog-functions" aria-label="Building actions"><button type="button" data-building-undo>Undo last drop</button><button type="button" data-building-toggle>Open / close aimed door</button></section></section><span class="rad-tox-colors" data-color-label="Brick colors" aria-label="Brick paint color">${SPRAY_COLORS.map((color,index)=>`<button type="button" class="rad-tox-color" data-brick-color="${index}" style="--paint-color:#${color.hex.toString(16).padStart(6,'0')}" aria-label="${color.name} bricks" aria-pressed="${index===0}"></button>`).join('')}</span></div>`; const buildingPopup=sprayTools.querySelector('[data-brick-material-menu]');const toolsToggle=sprayTools.querySelector('[data-rad-tools-toggle]'); document.body.append(sprayTools);
  const placementAdjustDialog=document.createElement('dialog');placementAdjustDialog.className='building-adjust-dialog';placementAdjustDialog.setAttribute('aria-label','Adjust building placement');placementAdjustDialog.innerHTML=`<header class="building-adjust-heading"><h2>Adjust item</h2><button type="button" data-adjust-cancel aria-label="Close item adjustment">×</button></header><div class="building-adjust-selection"><div class="building-adjust-modes"><button type="button" data-adjust-target="next" aria-pressed="true">Highlighted preview</button><button type="button" data-adjust-target="last" aria-pressed="false">Last placed item</button></div><p data-adjust-hint>Drag sliders to adjust the highlight. Apply keeps these settings for repeated drops.</p><div class="building-adjust-modes"><button type="button" data-adjust-mode="move" aria-pressed="true">Move XYZ</button><button type="button" data-adjust-mode="rotate" aria-pressed="false">Rotate XYZ</button></div></div><div class="building-adjust-axes">${['x','y','z'].map(axis=>`<label>${axis.toUpperCase()} <output data-adjust-output="${axis}">0</output><input type="range" data-adjust-axis="${axis}" min="-5" max="5" step=".05" value="0"></label>`).join('')}<label>Size <output data-adjust-output="scale">1</output><input type="range" data-adjust-axis="scale" min=".25" max="3" step=".05" value="1"></label></div><div class="building-adjust-modes building-adjust-footer"><button type="button" data-adjust-apply>Apply</button><button type="button" data-adjust-cancel>Cancel</button></div>`;document.body.append(placementAdjustDialog);
